A Ledger-valid transaction can balance in EUR while cost reports in SEK do not balance.

========== API ==========

balanceHistoryReport({ valuation: 'cost', dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity EUR
  format 1,000.00 EUR
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Foreign cost annotations on SEK postings
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK {2 EUR}
  Equity:Opening  -200 SEK {1 EUR}

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "-100",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[COST_BALANCE_MISMATCH] Transaction cost balance is -100 SEK; the balance and balance-history reports at cost using transaction dates require zero
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:9:1
